[en.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_ZEBRA]
The Southward Crusade

[en.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_ZEBRA_desc]
The Farasi has long been entrenched in the southern reaches of the Changeling Empire. It’s time to put an end to the zebra problem once and for all!

[zh.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_ZEBRA]
南下战争

[zh.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_ZEBRA_desc]
法拉希长久盘踞在幻形灵帝国的南部，如今是时候一劳永逸地解决斑马问题了！

